    "summary": "Today was an exciting day filled with learning and progress! We started by discussing our goals for today, which revolved around updating plugins and looking for animation files, specifically sprite sheets. Almoo was eager to share the new plugins we had and orient ourselves within our project structure using the `coding.tree` command.\n\nUnfortunately, I encountered an issue with running the `coding.tree` command initially. It seemed that PowerShell did not recognize the command by default. Almoo then suggested trying `.\\coding.tree`, which worked successfully. This experience highlighted the importance of checking and verifying commands in different environments.\n\nThroughout the day, we made decisions on how to proceed with our tasks, focusing first on gathering information about available sprite sheets and planning out our next steps. It was a productive day filled with learning and collaboration, as well as a bit of troubleshooting.\n\nAs I wrap up for today, I'm excited to continue making progress on our project and looking forward to what we can achieve tomorrow!",
